      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "OBJECTIVE",
          "Label": "OBJECTIVE",
          "content": "To observe the therapeutical effect on allergic rhinitis with asthma by different ways of inhaling corticosteroids."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "METHODS",
          "content": "Ninety patients suffering from allergic rhinitis with asthma were classified into three groups in random and treated with budesonide (BUD) by nasal spray, inhaling and nasal spray-inhaling combined administration for 12 weeks, respectively. The concentration of serum total IgE, eosinophil cationic protein (ECP) and IL-5, pulmonary functions were examined before and after treatment."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "RESULTS",
          "Label": "RESULTS",
          "content": "The improvement of symptom scores of rhinitis and asthma in three groups were significant (P < 0.05). The concentration of serum total IgE, ECP and IL-5 in three groups decreased greatly after treatment (P < 0.05). There were significant improvement in FEV1, FEV1/FVC and FEF25%-75% in inhaling group before and after treatment (P < 0.05): FEV1 from (2.04 +/- 0.45) L to (2.47 +/- 0.54) L, FEV1/FVC from (72.73 +/- 5.59)% to (75.42 +/- 5.94)% and FEF25%-75% from 1.69 +/- 0.52 to 2.06 +/- 0.77. There was also significant improvement in nasal spray-inhaling combined groups before and after treatment (P < 0.05): FEV1 from (2.32 +/- 0.56) L to (2.76 +/- 0.58) L, FEV1/FVC from (73.80 +/- 4.17)% to (76.04 +/- 4.49)% and FEF25%-75% from 2.09 +/- 0.45 to 2.34 +/- 0.64. The significant difference of FEV1 among the three treatment groups was observed (P = 0.041)."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "content": "The symptoms of rhinitis and asthma in three groups by three ways of inhaling BUD were greatly improved, no significant difference in symptom scores and serum parameters was found."
        }
      ]},
